                        "id":  "minor-lords-regional-collectors",
                        "title":  "Minor Lords as Regional Collectors",
                        "category":  "Factions",
                        "summary":  "Lesser dragons, Wyrmlords, and favored mortals govern local districts and personally enforce tribute collection.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Minor Lords account for goods before forwarding them to the [[tithe-fleet|Tithe Fleet]] or a Dragon Lord\u0027s lair. Warriors, beasts, and magical creatures accompany their circuits.",
                                     "Bells, drums, or magical signals announce an approaching collector, giving settlements time to prepare offerings, conceal shortages, or flee."
