                        "id":  "ritual-tribute-gatherings",
                        "title":  "Ritual Tribute Gatherings",
                        "category":  "Culture",
                        "summary":  "Traditionalist Dragon Lords turn taxation into public ceremony reinforcing their divine or royal status.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Communities gather at temples, platforms, or open fields with music, prayer, and offerings. The Dragon Lord or a magical projection may oversee presentation in person.",
                                     "The spectacle converts protection, fear, worship, and economic extraction into a single repeated civic ritual."
