                        "id":  "mark-of-rebellion",
                        "title":  "The Mark of Rebellion",
                        "category":  "Hazards",
                        "summary":  "An enchanted sky-visible sigil identifies settlements that failed or resisted draconic tribute.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "The mark warns dragons, enforcers, and other creatures that a community is condemned, exposing it to destruction, isolation, replacement of leadership, enslavement, or predation.",
                                     "Its purpose is exemplary terror: punishment continues beyond the original collection failure and makes assistance to the marked settlement dangerous."
